<view wx:if="{{aiEnabled}}" class="card ai-entry">
  <view class="section-title">AI 解读</view>
  <block wx:if="{{available}}">
    <view wx:if="{{interpretAvailable}}" class="ai-entry-text">约半分钟把这份通知的申报对象、条件、时间、材料等原文原句摘出来分好类，每条都能回原文核对。</view>
    <view wx:else class="ai-entry-text">把这份通知的申报条件和你填的企业情况并排列出，方便逐条自查，不判断能否申报。</view>
    <view class="btn-primary ai-entry-btn" bindtap="open" aria-role="button">{{interpretAvailable ? '开始解读' : '和我的企业对一下'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{interpretAvailable && clauseAvailable}}" class="link ai-entry-link" bindtap="openClause" aria-role="button">也可以直接和我的企业对一下</view>
  </block>
  <view wx:else class="ai-entry-text ai-entry-reason">{{reason}}</view>
</view>
